&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Title: CMBS / Structured Finance Attorney (NY / Chicago)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entity: Kroll Bond Rating Agency, LLC&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
