&lt;li&gt;Analytical and problem-solving skills with exceptional attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to interpret information from multiple internal and external sources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently while managing multiple priorities in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated commitment to data accuracy and operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
