&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting credit rating workflows or financial reference data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data governance, metadata, or data quality initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with entity, transaction, and security master data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with fixed-income securities, structured finance, corporate ratings, or related financial products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience leveraging &lt;strong&gt;generative AI tools&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., ChatGPT, Microsoft Copilot, Claude, Gemini, or similar) to automate routine tasks, analyze data, create documentation, and identify process improvement&lt;/p&gt;
